<span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-500">· Next review 2026-12-29</span></div><div class="quick-answer my-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-slate-50 dark:from-blue-950/60 dark:to-slate-800 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12A9 9 0 113 12a9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Quick Answer</span></div><p class="text-base sm:text-lg font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 leading-relaxed mb-0">Bari's only camera ZTL is the Città Vecchia, watched by seven gates. Permits go to residents and a few categories; nothing for tourists, hotel guests or EVs. Fine EUR 83-332.</p></div><div class="insider-angle my-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 dark:from-amber-950/60 dark:to-orange-950/50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 dark:border-amber-400 rounded-r-2xl p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54.0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464.0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">What Tourists Miss</span></div><p class="text-base sm:text-lg font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 leading-relaxed mb-0">Bari is the rare Italian art city where the hotel cannot fix a ZTL problem: no rule lets guests register a plate for the Città Vecchia, so even a quick luggage drop through one of the seven gates is an offence. Park outside the old town and walk in.</p></div><p class="not-prose my-4 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 border-l-2 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 pl-4">Locally the zone is called <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">ZTL Città Vecchia Bari</strong> (Italy) &mdash;
that is the wording on the boundary signs, on the official portal and on any penalty notice,
so it is the phrase to search for once you are there.</p><div class="not-prose my-6 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 dark:border-sky-800/50 bg-sky-50/50 dark:bg-sky-950/20 p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-400 mb-3">Next</p><ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm"><li><a href="/tools/emission-zone-checker/#city=bari" class="font-medium text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-300 underline">Check your own car against Bari</a>
