0 and 16:00-18:00, for eligible users</td></tr><tr><td>Permit</td><td>EUR 10, residents and listed categories only</td></tr><tr><td>Visitors and hotel guests</td><td>no permit and no plate-registration procedure</td></tr><tr><td>Electric cars</td><td>not exempt</td></tr><tr><td>Fine</td><td>EUR 83-332 (art. 7 c.14 CdS); 30% off within 5 days</td></tr><tr><td>Current rules since</td><td>30 January 2023</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><aside class="whats-changed my-6 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/60 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800" data-year=2026><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 mb-3 text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032.0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002.0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9"/></svg>
What changed in 2026</h3><div class="text-sm text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:ml-5"><ul><li><strong>One zone, not two.</strong> The camera ZTL is the Città Vecchia; the Murattiano grid has pedestrian streets such as Via Sparano and Via Argiro but no ZTL gates.</li><li><strong>Rules unchanged since January 2023.</strong> Ordinance 2023/00181 of 18 January 2023, following council decision 886 of 29 November 2022, applies from 30 January 2023.</li><li><strong>Fine</strong> is the statutory EUR 83-332 under article 7 comma 14.</li></ul></div></aside><aside class="sticker-checker my-8 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-sky-50 dark:from-indigo-950/60 dark:to-sky-950/60 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800" data-sticker-checker=bari><header class=mb-4><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-lg sm:text-xl mb-1">Can your vehicle enter Bari?</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Enter your vehicle details for an instant verdict on Bari's ZTL.</p></header><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-4"><div><label for=sc-bari-fuel class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Fuel type</label>
<select id=sc-bari-fuel class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-sm text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none"><option value=petrol>Petrol / Gasoline</option><option value=diesel>Diesel</option><option value=hybrid>Hybrid (petrol)</option><option value=plugin>Plug-in Hybrid</option><option value=electric>Electric (BEV)</option><option value=lpg>LPG / CNG</option></select></div><div><label for=sc-bari-euro class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Euro standard / year</label>
<select id=sc-bari-euro class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-sm text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none"><option value=6>Euro 6 (2015+)</option><option value=5>Euro 5 (2011-2014)</option><option value=4>Euro 4 (2006-2010)</option><option value=3>Euro 3 (2001-2005)</option><option value=2>Euro 2 (1997-2000)</option><option value=1>Euro 1 (1993-1996)</option><option value=0>Pre-1993</option></select></div><div class="flex items-end"><button type=button id=sc-bari-go class="w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition cursor-pointer">Check now</button></div></div><div id=sc-bari-result class=hidden aria-live=polite></div><noscript><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">JavaScript required for the instant check. Requirement: None — ANPR camera entry or permit required (Varies by municipality). Fine: EUR 83-332 (art. 7 c.14 Codice della Strada); 30% off if paid within 5 days.</p></noscript></aside><script>(function(){var a=0,r=0,e="Bari",t="None — ANPR camera entry or permit required",n="Varies by municipality",s="",o="EUR 83-332 (art. 7 c.14 Codice della Strada); 30% off if paid within 5 days",i=document.getElementById("sc-bari-go");if(!i)return;i.addEventListener("click",function(){var i,l,u,m,c=document.getElementById("sc-bari-fuel").value,d=parseInt(document.getElementById("sc-bari-euro").value,10)||0,f=document.getElementById("sc-bari-result"),p=c==="electric"||c==="plugin",h=c==="diesel"?r:a;p?(l="Go",i="emerald",u="Electric and plug-in hybrids are allowed in "+e+" without restriction."):d>=h?(l="Go",i="emerald",u="Your Euro "+d+" "+c+" vehicle meets "+e+"'s minimum (Euro "+h+"). You still need: "+t+(n?" ("+n+")":"")+"."):d>=h-1?(l="Conditional",i="amber",u="Your Euro "+d+" "+c+" is one step below "+e+"'s Euro "+h+" requirement. Check if exemptions apply (residents, weekends) or face a "+o+" fine."):(l="No-Go",i="red",u="Euro "+d+" "+c+" vehicles are not allowed in "+e+"'s zone. Entering risks a "+o+" fine. Park outside and use transit."),m="",s&&l!=="No-Go"&&(m='<a href="'+s+'" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-'+i+"-700 dark:text-"+i+'-300 underline">Buy '+t+" &rarr;</a>"),f.className="mt-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-"+i+"-50 dark:bg-"+i+"-900/20 border border-"+i+"-200 dark:border-"+i+"-800/50",f.innerHTML='<div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="flex-shrink-0 inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-'+i+"-100 dark:bg-"+i+"-900/40 text-"+i+"-800 dark:text-"+i+'-200 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">'+l+'</span><div class="flex-1 text-sm text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">'+u+m+"</div></div>"}),document.getElementById("sc-bari-fuel").addEventListener("change",function(){var e=document.getElementById("sc-bari-euro");this.value==="electric"?(e.value="6",e.disabled=!0):e.disabled=!1})})()</script><div class="lez-checker my-6 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 dark:from-emerald-950/60 dark:to-teal-950/60 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base sm:text-lg mb-1">Can your car enter Bari?</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Enter your vehicle's fuel + Euro class → instant verdict for Bari (ZTL). Fine if wrong: EUR 83-332 (art. 7 c.14 Codice della Strada); 30% off if paid within 5 days.</p></div><a href="/tools/emission-zone-checker/#city=bari" class="tm-btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm whitespace-nowrap transition">Check now
<svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg></a></div></div><h2 id=the-città-vecchia-ztl>The Città Vecchia ZTL</h2><p>The zone covers the whole old town inside Corso Vittorio Emanuele, Piazza Massari, Piazza Isabella d&rsquo;Aragona, Corso De Tullio, Lungomare Imperatore Augusto and Piazza IV Novembre. Access depends on a permit, never on Euro class.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Who may drive, and when</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Permit streets (<em>strade azzurre</em>)</td><td>permit holders only, at any hour; 20 km/h limit</td></tr><tr><td>Pedestrian areas</td><td>loading on working days 09:00-11:00 and 16:00-18:00, for licensed shops, regular suppliers and residents of the pedestrian areas; 20 minutes maximum with a parking disc</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=the-seven-gates>The seven gates</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Gate</th><th>Location</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>V1</td><td>Strada Porto Nuovo</td></tr><tr><td>V2</td><td>Via Ruggiero il Normanno</td></tr><tr><td>V3</td><td>Piazza Federico II di Svevia</td></tr><tr><td>V4</td><td>Via Benedetto Petrone</td></tr><tr><td>V5</td><td>Strada San Benedetto</td></tr><tr><td>V6</td><td>Via Michele Genovese</td></tr><tr><td>V7</td><td>Arco Largo Urbano II</td></tr></tbody></table><p>V1 to V5 lead to the permit streets; V6 and V7 open onto pedestrian areas and are for loading or reaching private driveways only.</p><div class="adbox my-8 text-center min-h-[100px] no-print"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 mb-1">Advertisement</div><ins class=adsbygoogle style=display:block data-ad-client=ca-pub-7423435551681993 data-ad-slot=2569874852 data-ad-format=auto data-full-width-responsive=true></ins><script>(adsbygoogle=window.adsbygoogle||[]).push({})</script></div><h2 id=staying-in-bari-vecchia>Staying in Bari Vecchia</h2><p>Bari differs from most Italian art cities here: <strong>the ZTL rules contain no plate registration for guests of hotels or B&amp;Bs</strong>. Every permit category is tied to living, working or owning a parking space in the old town. In practice:</p><ol><li>ask the accommodation before you arrive where the nearest car park outside the Città Vecchia is;</li><li>do not follow the satnav through a gate, not even to drop off luggage;</li><li>walk to your accommodation; the old town is compact.</li></ol><h2 id=who-can-get-a-permit>Who can get a permit</h2><p>AMTAB issues permits to residents, people living in the old town without residency there, owners of a parking space, journalists, doctors and carers. A permit costs <strong>EUR 10</strong>, one per household and one vehicle, and is digital, tied to the plate. Temporary permits, also EUR 10, exist only for a change of residence (90 days) or a new car (30 days). Disabled-badge holders request temporary access on the freephone number <strong>800 060 780</strong>.</p><p>Electric cars have no exemption: the rules admit only light electric vehicles that count as bicycles, where signs allow it.</p><div class="adbox my-8 text-center min-h-[280px] no-print"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 mb-1">Advertisement</div><ins class=adsbygoogle style=display:block;text-align:center data-ad-layout=in-article data-ad-format=fluid data-ad-client=ca-pub-7423435551681993 data-ad-slot=3754180199></ins><script>(adsbygoogle=window.adsbygoogle||[]).push({})</script></div><h2 id=fines>Fines</h2><p>Neither the Comune nor AMTAB sets its own amount. The penalty is that of <strong>article 7 comma 14 of the Codice della Strada</strong>, <strong>EUR 83 to EUR 332</strong>, reduced by 30% if paid within five days. Since 14 December 2024, repeat passes into the same zone on one calendar day make a single violation (art. 198 c.2-bis), and with a hire car the rental firm passes the notice on with its own fee.</p><h2 id=driving-on-to-the-rest-of-italy>Driving on to the rest of Italy</h2><p>Speed limits, alcohol rules and required equipment are in the <a href=/driving/italy/>Italy driving guide</a>; winter-tyre rules are in <a href=/tyre-laws/italy/>Italy tyre laws</a>. The general emergency number is <strong>112</strong>.</p><h2 id=sources>Sources</h2><ul><li>AMTAB, the ZTL area: <a href=https://www.amtab.it/it/zona-a-traffico-limitato/la-zona-ztl>amtab.it</a></li><li>AMTAB, ZTL rules, gates and loading slots: <a href=https://www.amtab.it/it/zona-a-traffico-limitato/regolamento-ztl>amtab.it</a></li><li>AMTAB, how permits are issued: <a href=https://www.amtab.it/it/zona-a-traffico-limitato/modalita-di-rilascio>amtab.it</a></li><li>Polizia Locale di Bari, ZTL permits and ordinance 2023/00181: <a href=https://www.poliziamunicipalebari.it/home-page/cosa-fare-in-caso-di/rilascio-permessi-ztl/>poliziamunicipalebari.it</a></li><li>Codice della Strada, art. 7 c.14: <a href=https://www.normattiva.it/uri-res/N2Ls?urn:nir:stato:decreto.legislativo:1992-04-30;285~art7>normattiva.it</a></li></ul><section class="changelog my-8 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base sm:text-lg mb-4"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5H7A2 2 0 005 7v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
